WEBVTT

00:15:28.550 --> 00:15:31.601
A ipak, svaki korak naprijed

00:15:31.601 --> 00:15:33.667
je tako sladak.

00:15:33.667 --> 00:15:37.321
U 2007., šest godina nakon upoznavanja,

00:15:37.321 --> 00:15:39.378
moj partner i ja odlučili

00:15:39.378 --> 00:15:41.112
smo stupiti u brak.

00:15:41.112 --> 00:15:43.294
Upoznati Johna bilo je otkriće

00:15:43.294 --> 00:15:45.150
velike sreće

00:15:45.150 --> 00:15:48.250
i otklanjanje velike tuge,

00:15:48.250 --> 00:15:50.864
i ponekad sam bio toliko okupiran

00:15:50.864 --> 00:15:53.365
nestankom sve te boli

00:15:53.365 --> 00:15:55.717
da sam zaboravio na radost,

00:15:55.717 --> 00:15:59.464
što je isprva bio manje 
dojmljiv dio toga za mene.

00:15:59.464 --> 00:16:02.165
Brak je bio način da izrazimo našu ljubav